    "body": "Now that I'm writing up the `ImageData` proposal, I am noticing that this gets a bit hairy. Consider, for example:\n\n```\n   let myFloat16Array = new Float16Array(4*w*h);\n   let myImageData = new ImageData(myFloat16Array, w, h, {colorSpace:\"rec2100-linear\"});\n```\n\nThis would throw an exception because of a mismatch. This probably just boils down to the \"bad\" `getImageData` default.",
